  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Follow-up trade mission to Benin 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the second week of September 2025, a trade mission on sustainable agriculture and water sector was organised to Benin with 17 Dutch organisations and companies participating.This assignment aims to provide follow-up on the activities and business-to-business relations initiated during the trade mission (PTM25BJ01). The purpose of the trade mission was to better position the Netherlands as a partner of Benin by involving and engaging Dutch companies and knowledge institutions to Benin and let them be part of contributing to solutions for key challenges in the Beninese agriculture and water sector.In this follow-up trajectory, aim is to concretise opportunities for Dutch knowledge and expertise to contribute to sustainable agriculture and water sector in Benin by seeking collaboration between Dutch and Beninese companies.</narrative>
  </description>
